{"scope":"rt-d7bc8c553b","css":".rt-d7bc8c553b p.MsoNormal, .rt-d7bc8c553b li.MsoNormal, .rt-d7bc8c553b div.MsoNormal {margin:0cm; font-size:12.0pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;}\n.rt-d7bc8c553b div.WordSection1 {}","html":"<div class=WordSection1>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US>DEPARTMENT\r\nOF RADIOLOGY &amp; IMAGING<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US>U.S.G\u00a0\r\nOF KUB (MALE)<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US>--------------------<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>RIGHT KIDNEY : Right kidney is normal in\r\nshape, size and dimension.Normal <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>Cortical echogenecity is seen.Cortico\r\nmedullary echo differentiation is <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>normal.Normal pelvi caliceal system is\r\nnoted in right kidney.No calculus \/ <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>cyst \/ solid mass \/hydronephrosis is noted.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>Right Kidney measures : 0.00 x 0.00\r\ncm(approx).<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>LEFT KIDNEY : Left kidney is normal in\r\nshape, size and dimension.Normal <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>Cortical echogenecity is seen.Cortico\r\nmedullary echo differentiation is <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>normal.Normal pelvi caliceal system is\r\nnoted in left kidney.No calculus \/ <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>cyst \/ solid mass \/hydronephrosis is noted.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>Left Kidney measures : 0.00 x 0.00\r\ncm(approx).<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>KIDNEYS\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 : Both kidneys are normal in\r\nshape, size and dimension.Normal <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>Cortical echogenecity is seen.Cortico\r\nmedullary echo differentiation is <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>normal.Normal pelvi caliceal system is\r\nnoted in both kidney.No calculus \/ <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>cyst \/ solid mass \/hydronephrosis is noted.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>Right Kidney Measure : 00 x 00 cm.(approx).<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>Left\u00a0 Kidney Measure\u00a0 : 00 x 00\r\ncm.(approx).<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>URINARY BLADDER : It is optimally\r\ndistended. Wall is normal in thickness. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 No\r\nfocal lesion is detected.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>PROSTATE\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 : Prostate is normal in\r\nsize and shape. Parenchymal echotexture <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 is\r\nhomogeneous. No significant internal calcific foci \/ corpora<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 amylaces\r\ndeposit is noted. Capsular outline appears intact.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Prostate\r\nmeasures : 0.0 x 0.0 x 0.0 cm.(approx) and <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 volume :\u00a0\u00a0\r\ncc.(approx).<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>POST VOID\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 : Post void residual\r\nvolume of\u00a0 urine is insignificant and<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 measures :\u00a0\r\ncc (approx).<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>ILIAC FOSSA SCAN : Both iliac fossae appear\r\nnormal. No obvious collection \/ SOL <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\nseen.Both psoas muscles are normal.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>IMPRESSION\u00a0 : USG OF KUB REVEALS NO OBVIOUS\r\nABNORMALITY.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span 